===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|pl|kanał}}, from {{der|ru|it|canale}}, from {{der|ru|la|canalis}}, from {{m|la|canna}}, from {{m|grc|κάννα}}. {{doublet|ru|кана́л}}.

